# Collapse AI-assistant + CI cache bot identities into the canonical
# author so GitHub's contributors page and `git shortlog` don't list
# them alongside the human author. thb-bumpbot is intentionally NOT
# collapsed - those commits are the version-bump audit trail and the
# author wants them visible.
#
# Format per row: <canonical name> <canonical-email> <matched-name> <matched-email>
# Lines starting with # are comments. Updates apply retroactively to
# all of git history - no rebase required.

